      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Janus Emblem"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 50 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 80 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 20 boxes"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Everyone wants to have good luck at the turn of the new year. It sold quite well — a pity it is emblazoned with Janus' insignia, so it's really hard to come by.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ad0ff391c6722577"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Recycling Service"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: -"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 300 Balance Coins/trip"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 70 (3 dromases rented, 1 temp staff)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Dromases are pretty useful, but they have an exorbitant rental fee. They're charging threefold the price during the new year — it's sheer daylight robbery! Ack! If only I could buy a dromas of my own...*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-119c0e5001a49f76"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Gilded Silk Handkerchief"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 40 Balance Coins (Blank silk handkerchief), 150 Balance Coins (Customized name embroidery service)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 2,500 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 25"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Products still have to be related to the Chrysos Heirs to be popular.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e5ba413050a90f2d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Tidal Holy Water (Blessed by Phagousa)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 100 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 200 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 15"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Said to be able to cleanse the black tide, though I reckon it's a scam. Even newcomers to the city aren't buying it, and it reeks of fermentation. Never stock up on this stuff again. No one's buying any of this.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a4d8470d551aa35c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Talanton's scale and weights set"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 500 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 1,200 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 70"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Gotta hand it to the merchant guild for having foresight and deep pockets! Buying so many in one go, I'd be ashamed if I didn't give them a discount!*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e30074180b96702a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2."
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Talanton's Legal Commentary"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 120 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 200 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 30"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Everyone in Okhema should learn legal knowledge!*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-108450d8546820e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Contract Paper"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 5 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 10 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 2,000"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Everyone is busy signing contracts this month, and I am no exception.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-89c1517bb8e0af54"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Oath Candle"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 30 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 99 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 150"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*The younger folk sure love buying this. I can smell an opportunity... Going to stock this up in advance next year.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-51c1947db19b819a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Talanton's Notary Seal Set"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 800 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 954 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 300"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*The guild of rhetoric teachers pre-ordered these. Can't earn much from it.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0e8233814da61a23"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Oronyx Astral Chart"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 1,000 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 1,500 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 150"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*I don't get it. You can't see any stars in Okhema, yet those astrologers are scrambling to buy this. What exactly are they looking at?*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-85826e844f52dad6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Invigorating Incense Pack"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 400 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 600 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 50"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*With that stinging smell, it's no wonder it's invigorating!*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8714918eba85f2a9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Divining Sheep-Bone Tile Set"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: -"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 190 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 30"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Zero-cost business is always the best, apart from the trouble needed to carve sheep bone.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-12509d02e2a77b2b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Veil of Evernight Tent"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 2,000 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 2,750 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 50"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*A new favorite of rich folks. Apparently, it provides a great night's sleep when spread over your bed. I wonder if that's true?*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-22fa04f53c42b04f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "5. Obsidian Dagger"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 500 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 800 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 30"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*With an unsharpened edge, I have no idea what the point of this dagger is, but Oronyx's disciples love this.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9522bc18077ed78f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Bug Repellent"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 20 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 25 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 800"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Mediocre effect, but wins out in price. I also don't feel good making money off farmers. I mean, I am a farmer's child after all...*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b25caaaece723e73"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Rainwater Collector"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 2,000 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 2,800 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 100"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Those who fear dry seasons have all gotten one. Word is going around that the harvest in the next few years will be affected by the black tide, though I remain suspicious.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8b2f1bab59fa9100"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Dromas Feed Bag (Rainbow Soil)"
