              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 260 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 390 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 40"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*It is said that the water drunk from this cup is particularly sweet.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b4cffa9454dbe21d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Ribbon (Waterproof Coated)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 30 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 40 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 800"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Everyone is preparing for the festivities.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6983a41ed2e06781"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Woven Garland"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 20 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 35 Balance Coins, 30 Balance Coins, 25 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 5"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*These aren't selling well. So frustrating. Everyone still prefers to make their own.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f1547c205e68f8bb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Aquila Energy Lamp"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 200 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 300 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 0"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*Said to store light. I thought Aquila disciples would go wild for this... But I forgot it's always bright in Okhema. This was a drastic mistake!*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c261545a95c94dfa"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Linen Sun Hat"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purchase Price: 40 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sale Price: 50 Balance Coins"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Units Sold: 80"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "*I learnt a lesson from that energy lamp fiasco. Since it's always bright in Okhema, there'll definitely be people needing this.*"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ae01559861816e8d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
